      "heading": "Telling the regulator is separate",
      "html": "<p>A RIDDOR report does not replace a notice to the regulator. One incident can need both, one, or neither. The lists and deadlines differ in England, Scotland, Wales and Northern Ireland. Use the current guidance from the HSE and the regulator.</p>"
